        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG414-630,  9-1/4\" Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary styled door handle is made of solid stainless steel by AHI Hardware. It has a Satin Stainless Steel finish. Clean and stylishly designed, stainless steel requires very little maintenance. The Contemporary 9-1/4 Inch Door Pull will enhance any setting where a clean contemporary look is desired. This modern door pull features a nice sized 1 inch round/flat grip handle that is very comfortable. It features stylish sleek mitered corners. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, metal or glass doors. Clean, Contemporary, Solid. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG414-specifications.gif?v=1704442264\" width=\"260\" height=\"312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG414 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the AHI SIG414-630 Contemporary Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li> \r\n<li>Total Height: 9-1/8\" (231 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/2\" (216 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\" (64 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1\" (25 mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>Item Discontinued. Available <a href=\"/collections/door-pulls\">Door Pills</a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary 9-1/4 Inch Door Pull",
                "description": "This contemporary styled door handle is made of solid stainless steel by AHI Hardware. It has a Satin Stainless Steel finish. Clean and stylishly designed, stainless steel requires very little maintenance. The Contemporary 9-1/4 Inch Door Pull will enhance any setting where a clean contemporary look is desired. This modern door pull features a nice sized 1 inch round/flat grip handle that is very comfortable. It features stylish sleek mitered corners. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, metal or glass doors. Clean, Contemporary, Solid. \r\n",
